      "writtenOn": "2025-01-07T04:36:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ll add comments in next patch.\n\nI like the idea but I think the majority of ageing is done where aged2 is not in the picture. So `dirty\u003d2, aged\u003d1, clean\u003d0` would make ageing faster with `card \u003e\u003e\u003d 1`. The `aged2\u003d4` probably can be dealth with a rotating shift.\n\nBut I think it would be better to make this change in a separate CL. This one is already too long and complex.",
      "parentUuid": "25ea35a8_b1ac292c",
